  "managementDiscussion": "In fiscal year FY2026, Tata Consultancy Services recorded revenue of \u20b92.91 lakh crore, growing 6.0% year-on-year, driven by continued momentum across BFSI, Retail & CPG. Net income stood at \u20b90.58 lakh crore with a net margin of 20.0% and a return on equity of 37.0%. Operating cash flow remained robust at \u20b90.67 lakh crore, supporting capital expenditure of \u20b90.05 lakh crore and a free cash flow of \u20b90.62 lakh crore. The company maintains a measured capital structure with net debt-to-equity of -0.19x. Management continues to invest in digital and AI capabilities, expects sustained volume-led growth and disciplined cost control, and remains committed to value-accretive capital allocation and sustainable returns for shareholders.",
